      "tool": "take-environment-snapshot",
      "description": "Snapshot this VM's disk. Call only after the final update script has run successfully and all setup work is complete. Call it alone: never in the same message as another tool call, and never while a background subagent is working in this VM. It pauses the VM while it captures the disk, and tool calls that overlap the pause can hang. Returns a snapshot id once the capture finishes, usually within seconds; the upload then continues in the background, so use check-environment-snapshot to monitor it. If this run already has a snapshot uploading, returns that snapshot instead of starting another. If the VM changed after that existing snapshot began, wait for it to finish and then call this tool again.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "additionalProperties": false
